<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak April jobless rate dips to 12.96 pct.</title>
<headline>Slovak April jobless rate dips to 12.96 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The total number of jobless in Slovakia in April was 337,180, or 12.96 percent of the workforce, the National Labour Office said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In March, 349,658 people, or 13.44 percent, were officially without employment.  </p>
<p> SLOVAK UNEMPLOYMENT	 APRIL 1997  MARCH 1997  APRIL 1996</p>
<p>  Total jobless		 337,180     349,658     321,881</p>
<p>  Percentage of workforce    12.96	 13.44	 12.5</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
